  "title": "Springfield Cashew Chicken",
  "description": "This version of cashew chicken fries the chicken in peanut oil and covers it with an oyster sauce-based sauce. It&#39;s served with a sprinkling of cashews and green onions.",
  "authors": [
    "Perri Pender"
  ],
